WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.060
If ICE can show up and bother some guys at their roofing job, then bystanders should be able to

00:05.060 --> 00:11.440
bother ICE at their state-sanctioned kidnapping job. It is only fair. The left's also putting

00:11.440 --> 00:16.020
pressure on small businesses. After they firebomb their stores during the summer of love,

00:16.420 --> 00:22.320
rioters are now saying, don't cooperate with ICE. You have a nice store there. Hate to see you lose it.

